ir London</a><a href="/freezer-repair-london.asp">Freezer Repair London</a><a href="/chiller-repair-london.asp">Chiller Repair London</a><a href="/wine-cooler-repair-london.asp">Wine Cooler Repair London</a><a href="/cellar-cooler-repair-london.asp">Cellar Cooler Repair London</a><a href="/bottle-cooler-repair-london.asp">Bottle Cooler Repair London</a><a href="/polar-fridge-repair-london.asp">Polar Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/williams-fridge-repair-london.asp">Williams Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/foster-fridge-repair-london.asp">Foster Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/display-fridge-repair-london.asp">Display Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/ice-machine-repair-london.asp">Ice Machine Repair London</a><a href="/dairy-cabinet-repair-london.asp">Dairy Cabinet Repair London</a><a href="/ice-cream-machine-repair-london.asp">Ice Cream Machine Repair London</a><a href="/subzero-fridge-repair-london.asp">Subzero Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/adexa-fridge-repair-london.asp">Adexa Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/empire-fridge-repair-london.asp">Empire Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/commercial-appliances-repair-london.asp">Commercial Appliances Repair London</a><a href="/catering-repair-london.asp">Catering Repair London</a><a href="/appliances-repair-london.asp">Appliances Repair London</a><a href="/walk-in-fridge-repair-london.asp">Walk In Fridge Repair London</a><a href="/walk-in-freezer-repair-london.asp">Walk In Freezer Repair London</a><a href="/walk-in-cold-room-repair-london.asp">Walk In Cold Room Repair London</a></div></details><a href="/commercial-fridge-repair-london/">Commercial</a><a class="text-[#087d90]" href="contact.asp">Book a repair ↗</a></nav></div></header><main id="content"><section class="wrap py-12 lg:py-16"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] gap-10 items-center"><div><p class="text-sm tracking-widest font-bold text-[#087080] mb-5">LONDON · HERE WHEN YOU NEED US</p><h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] max-w-3xl">Commercial Fridge Repair London - 24/7 Emergency</h1><div class="bg-gray-50 py-2 px-4 border-y flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 svc-tagbar"><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Services:</span><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="commercial-freezer-repair-london.asp">Commercial Freezer</a><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="cold-room-repair-london.asp">Cold Room</a><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="freezer-room-repair-london.asp">Freezer Room</a><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="walk-in-fridge-repair-london.asp">Walk-in Fridge</a><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="walk-in-freezer-repair-london.asp">Walk-in Freezer</a><a class="text-xs bg-white border px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full" href="walk-in-cold-room-repair-london.asp">Walk-in Cold Room</a></div><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mt-6">ColdDirect: commercial refrigeration repairs for shops, restaurants, cafes, supermarkets and hotels. B2B only. Receive a clear price after diagnosis, before work begins. Call to discuss the next available emergency visit.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-7"><a class="call" href="tel:+447983759320">Call 07983 759320 ↗</a><a class="inline-flex items-center font-bold px-2 py-3 text-[#087080]" href="contact.asp">Request a booking →</a></div><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4">Same day visits subject to availability. Appointment confirmed by our team.</p></div><div class="bg-[#102f40] text-white rounded-2xl p-8"><p class="text-[#d5f763] text-sm font-bold tracking-widest">LET’S GET IT SORTED</p><p class="text-4xl font-bold mt-5 mb-2">24/7</p><p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">Emergency contact</p><div class="border-t border-white/20 pt-5"><p class="font-bold">B2B only - Engineer attends site, diagnoses and provides price before work</p><p class="font-bold mt-3">All jobs come with warranty</p><p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">Ask about cover for your repair.</p></div><a class="block text-sm mt-6 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://www.google.com/search?q=ColdDirect+London+Google+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find Google reviews ↗</a></div></div></section><div class="bg-white border-y border-slate-200"><div class="wrap grid lg:grid-cols-[250px_1fr] gap-12 py-12"><aside><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-6"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 text-[#087080]">On this page</p><nav aria-label="On this page"><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#services">Services</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#commercial-refrigeration">Commercial refrigeration for London businesses</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#areas-covered">Areas we cover</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#why-colddirect">Why business customers choose ColdDirect</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#business-repairs">Commercial fridge repair for working businesses</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#diagnosis-pricing">Diagnosis and pricing before work</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#book-a-visit">Book a commercial refrigeration visit</a><a class="block py-2 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="#warranty-follow-up">Warranty and follow-up arrangements</a></nav><div class="mt-7 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5"><p class="font-bold mb-3">Your next step</p><a class="call" href="contact.asp">Book a repair →</a></div></div></aside><article class="copy max-w-3xl"><section id="commercial-refrigeration"><h2>Commercial refrigeration for London businesses</h2><p>ColdDirect is a commercial-only refrigeration repair service for business customers. We support enquiries from shops, restaurants, cafes, supermarkets and hotels that need to arrange attention to their refrigeration equipment. Call with your postcode, equipment type and symptoms to discuss the next available visit. Our focus is business premises, site access and a clear plan for the proposed work.</p><p>Our engineer will attend your site, carry out diagnosis and provide a clear price before starting any work. The final cost depends on parts and labour required. Tell us who can authorise the work and whether your business requires a purchase order. For an urgent issue, call rather than waiting for an email reply. Emergency contact is available around the clock, while appointment times and any parts-dependent completion dates must be confirmed by the team.</p></section><section id="areas-covered"><h2>Areas we cover</h2><p>Contact ColdDirect about commercial repair appointments across London, including North, South, East, West and Central London. Give the full site postcode so the team can discuss availability for your business. Enquiries include Camden, Islington, Barnet, Enfield, Hackney, Haringey, Westminster, the City of London, Stratford, Walthamstow, Ilford and Harrow. Confirm attendance for the specific address when you call.</p><p>For multi-site businesses, specify the branch where the faulty equipment is located. Explain any loading restrictions, parking arrangements, security procedures or contractor access hours. If your business is outside London, tell us the location and ask whether a visit can be arranged. An area listing is an invitation to enquire, not a promise of immediate attendance at every address.</p></section><section id="why-colddirect"><h2>Why business customers choose ColdDirect</h2><p>Business repairs need practical communication. ColdDirect offers 24/7 emergency contact, equipment-specific booking options and a direct way to explain the issue before an appointment is agreed. Tell us your trading hours, the person providing access and who should receive the proposed repair details. These arrangements help the visit fit the way your premises operates.</p><p>Ask about the advertised warranty and the scope of cover for your commercial repair. You can look for customer feedback using the Google reviews link. We do not add unverified ratings or invent customer endorsements. Before you authorise work, discuss the assessment charge, proposed repair cost and any follow-up visit or parts requirement. Clear details help the site contact and the person approving expenditure stay informed.</p></section><section id="business-repairs"><h2>Commercial fridge repair for working businesses</h2><p>A commercial fridge is part of the daily operation, whether it holds ingredients behind a restaurant kitchen, drinks behind a bar or products on a shop floor. When something changes, the immediate question is how to arrange a useful response with as little disruption as possible. ColdDirect takes commercial refrigeration enquiries across London and offers 24/7 emergency contact. Call with your postcode, equipment details and a clear description of the fault.</p><p>Tell us whether the site is open, preparing for service or closed for the night. Include the name and phone number of the person who can provide access and approve discussions about the work. A repair appointment is easier to arrange when these details are available at the start. Same day attendance must be confirmed with the team and depends on the location, current workload and the equipment involved.</p></section><section id="diagnosis-pricing"><h2>Diagnosis and pricing before work</h2><p>Our engineer will attend your site, carry out diagnosis and provide a clear price before starting any work. The final cost depends on parts and labour required.</p><p>Tell us if your business requires a purchase order or approval from a manager before work starts. Include the correct trading name and billing contact with your enquiry. If the assessment identifies additional work, ask for the revised scope and cost before authorising it. For multi-site businesses, identify the affected branch clearly so attendance and paperwork relate to the right premises.</p></section><section id="book-a-visit"><h2>Book a commercial refrigeration visit</h2><p>Call 07983 759320 for 24/7 emergency contact. Have your business name, site postcode, equipment type and a short description of the problem ready. Same day attendance is subject to availability, and the team must confirm the appointment with you. Let us know when staff can provide access and whether loading or parking restrictions apply.</p><p>Our booking form offers Display Fridge, Walk-in Fridge, Walk-in Freezer, Commercial Upright Fridge, Chest Freezer and Cold Room. The form prepares an email in your own email application. You must send the message for ColdDirect to receive it; completing the form does not automatically submit a booking. For urgent refrigeration problems, call to discuss the next step rather than relying on an email response.</p></section><section id="warranty-follow-up"><h2>Warranty and follow-up arrangements</h2><p>Ask how ColdDirect’s advertised warranty applies to the proposed commercial repair. Keep the assessment and repair documents with your equipment records so the site manager can refer to the agreed work. If a part needs ordering, discuss the expected lead time and how a return visit will be arranged. Attendance alone is not a guarantee that every repair can be completed immediately.</p><p>You can follow the Google reviews link to look for feedback about ColdDirect. Before confirming work, ask any questions about the scope, payment arrangements and contact for follow-up. We work with business customers, and a clear approval process helps everyone understand what has been requested, what has been agreed and who needs to be kept informed.</p></section></article></div></div><section class="wrap py-12"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Ready to talk about your repair?</h2><p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Have your postcode, brand and a short description of the problem ready.</p><a class="call" href="tel:+447983759320">Call 07983 759320 ↗</a></section></main><section class="wrap py-12 seo-home-links">
